# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# A linked WhatsApp session contains account credentials.
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens and client secrets
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# meeting recordings + transcripts (WAV can be 100 MB/hour)
meetings/*.wav
meetings/*.txt
# research reports, saved macros, diagrams/charts, phone-camera frames,
# tool outputs — all regenerated on demand, never source
research/
macros/
diagrams/
charts/
uploads/
config/automation_rules.json

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Archives — never commit source zips (Mark-LV-main.zip was 450 KB of the
# repo's own tree sitting in the repo) ────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz


# make_3d output — generated meshes, not source
models/
# password vault — never commit
config/vault.enc
# event-dedup state
memory/events_fired.json
memory/history.db
memory/rag.db
memory/dots_pcs/
config/dots_slack.json
